sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Analyst component
  participant APIjs as api.js
  participant MW as request_context middleware
  participant R as FastAPI route
  participant Log as structured logging
  participant Toast as App.jsx toast tray
  participant Admin as IngestLogPage.jsx

  UI->>APIjs: fetch /api/...
  APIjs->>MW: HTTP request
  MW->>MW: request_id_var.set (X-Request-ID)
  MW->>R: handle request

  alt success
    R-->>APIjs: 200 + X-Request-ID header
    APIjs-->>UI: parsed data
  else expected 4xx
    R-->>Log: log with request_id
    R-->>APIjs: 4xx JSON detail + X-Request-ID
    APIjs->>APIjs: err.requestId = header
    APIjs-->>UI: throw Error with message + requestId
    opt not 401 or 422
      UI->>Toast: notifyApiError(err)
      Toast->>UI: toast — detail + ref link
    end
    UI->>UI: inline error state — message + ref + retry
  else unexpected 5xx
    R-->>Log: full traceback + request_id
    R-->>APIjs: 500 generic detail + X-Request-ID
    APIjs-->>UI: throw with requestId
    UI->>Toast: notifyApiError(err)
    UI->>UI: inline error state — message + ref + retry
  end

  User->>Toast: click ref link
  Toast->>Admin: /admin?p=ingestlog&request_id=...
  Admin->>Admin: filter logs by request_id

  Note over R: PoolExhaustedError → 503<br/>"Server busy — please retry shortly" (A4)
